					"content": "好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230250811
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230250811,
					"content": "拜托了，旅行者，我会好好准备报酬的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "法伽尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 230250812,
					"content": "下次可以先考虑好怎么回收…",
